{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE3L0MlMjdlc3QlMjBMYSUyMFZpZSUyMSUyMCUyODIwMTclMjkv","type":"movie","name":"C'est La Vie!","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/e9hIxAKPdXo9Fgwca6vT4USOXK6.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/10ECHyeW7vZMjCLSRLak9K5fVdB.jpg","description":"Max is a battle-weary veteran of the wedding-planning racket. His latest — and last — gig is a hell of a fête, involving stuffy period costumes for the caterers, a vain, hyper- sensitive singer who thinks he's a Gallic James Brown, and a morose, micromanaging groom determined to make Max's night as miserable as possible. But what makes the affair too bitter to endure is that Max's colleague and ostensible girlfriend, Joisette, seems to have written him off, coolly going about her professional duties while openly flirting with a much younger server. It's going to be a very long night… especially once the groom's aerial serenade gets underway.\n\nReleased 4 Oct 2017 · France · Language: French · 115 min\nStudio: Gaumont, Quad Films\n\nOn your server — Audio: French","releaseInfo":"2017","genres":["Comedy","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.0","imdb_id":"tt5699154","moviedb_id":432068,"tmdbId":432068,"runtime":"115 min","cast":["Jean-Pierre Bacri","Gilles Lellouche","Jean-Paul Rouve","Vincent Macaigne","Alban Ivanov","Eye Haïdara","Suzanne Clément","Hélène Vincent"],"director":["Éric Toledano","Olivier Nakache"],"writer":["Olivier Nakache","Éric Toledano"],"released":"2017-10-04T00:00:00.000Z","country":"France","language":"French","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Éric Toledano","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9axN13gdsRpQLKqmvibsc9jqK2q.jpg"},{"name":"Jean-Pierre Bacri","character":"Max","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/h1YxoWMCv0vN6xoK1H4GMqFtdy7.jpg"},{"name":"Gilles Lellouche","character":"James","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5Ka9nodCWS6TRFJnmosjp9sV3iA.jpg"},{"name":"Jean-Paul Rouve","